<title>JAPAN: Shin Nikkei files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Shin Nikkei files 20 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shin Nikkei Co Ltd said on Monday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 20 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective from January 18.</p>
<p>Shin Nikkei is a maker of building materials.</p>
